      "sourceLink": null,
      "spam": false,
      "statusChangeID": null,
      "value": "Having a HUD element stuck to my face gives me motion sickness, so i am forced to turn off the HUD to hide the mic icon. But then i cant recieve invites or requests from friends. This messes with my social life, and I dont have a choice because I dont want to throw up from motion sickness. I have other friends who feel the same way. Please implement a simple toggle for the mic icon.",
