      "statusChangeID": null,
      "value": "Seeing the mic icon always on my face genuinely makes me uncomfortable like a eyelash in my eye and I don't want to turn off invites/requests. If the argument against this is people way not know they are muted and elad to unintended situations the hud toggle already causes this issue and its in the game! And tbh it's not a issue at all",
